      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was still needed due to the way the code was written (`implicitSdkLib` initialized to `nil`. So if it was a real SDK library, the line 1787 would set `implicitSdkLib` to the name of the SDK library. Simply removing that line would make even the Soong tests fail.\n\nI rewrote the code to explicitly use `depName` in that case and make sure that it\u0027s the same as the one returned by `OptionalImplicitSdkLibrary()`, just to be on the safe side.",
      "parentUuid": "9bcfcabb_5332850c",
      "revId": "9534b9e0be787236408d6191177487c7be29c498",
