      "message": "Done, with a couple of changes:\n- except for `SdkLibraryDependency` it should also be a shared library\n- immediate return for `SdkLibraryComponentDependency` doesn\u0027t work (it makes TestJavaSdkLibrary and other tests fail, because for \"qux\" the transitive SDK library dependencies \"foo\" and \"bar\" do not get added) Test: https://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/build/soong/java/sdk_library_test.go;l\u003d86-91 I\u0027m not sure why \"foo\" is not added, it seems that it should be pulled from \"baz\" `libs` dependencies. For \"bar\" it makes sense, as \"baz\" depends on stubs.",
